Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn汉仪正圆-35S\fs40\1c&H4F4C4E&\an7\3c&HE5E5E7&\bord3\frx0\fry358\pos(802,541.479)\frz355.8}丽奈今天有补习？
